[{"id":165716900,"discussion_id":"20718fdcc6e0e6dc8a3208675b25c440874ecef5","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-transformer/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| mc2 | ✅ [*wang-minbo*](https://gitcode.com/wang-minbo), [*liuboxi*](https://gitcode.com/liuboxi) (2/2) | ✅ [*wang-minbo*](https://gitcode.com/wang-minbo) (1/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n\n------\n\n## CLA Signature Pass  \n ryan_li, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-03-19T11:26:16+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T11:15:15+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165716922,"discussion_id":"a80e7f4acefe0248d6d0a15e16a055b766f7e1b1","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-03-19T11:26:22+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-19T11:26:22+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165717966,"discussion_id":"97a1561bce7cb2ac9e34ad7be06bc95b0ceba715","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR集中修复了多个矩阵乘法相关算子（包括基础切分、AllGatherMatmul、MatmulAlltoAll、MatmulReduceScatter）在属性参数处理和错误信息格式化中存在的类型安全与健壮性问题。主要问题包括：在读取`int64_t`类型的算子属性时使用了`int`类型指针，导致潜在的数据截断或解释错误；在错误报告和日志打印中，格式化字符串占位符（如`%d`）与实际的`int64_t`参数类型不匹配，可能引发未定义行为；部分校验逻辑存在冗余或空指针风险。这些问题可能影响算子在特定条件下的稳定性和计算正确性。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改方案统一针对类型不一致和逻辑缺陷进行修正。核心内容包括：将涉及`comm_turn`、`blockSize`、`gatherIndex`、量化模式等属性的指针类型从`int*`统一更正为`int64_t*`，确保属性读取的类型安全。同步将所有对应的错误信息格式化占位符从`%d`修正为`%ld`。优化了`AllGatherMatmul`算子的参数校验逻辑，增加了必要的空指针检查并移除了冗余校验。在`MatmulAlltoAll`算子的量化类型计算中，增加了显式的类型转换以避免潜在溢出。这些修改消除了类型不匹配导致的未定义行为风险，提升了代码的健壮性和可维护性。","created_at":"2026-03-19T11:31:23+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-19T11:31:23+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165728958,"discussion_id":"8d4d6f96de3a1b01241f470621b60d977cb44d21","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-03-19T14:07:03+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-19T14:07:03+08:00","user":{"id":"68848931f519ba33f1cf1993","login":"ryan_li","object_id":"68848931f519ba33f1cf1993","name":"liyang","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/ryan_li"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165729064,"discussion_id":"bcbf3d0908412b2831fa774468dfa7a36192a7de","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=0d4f52bd3a494432a028df25bc3297f8&pipelineRunId=e9b44a8450ed4c8fa3a3958a2217dde1&projectName=CANN'>e9b44a8450ed4c